Jer 6:1 , The enemies sent against Judah
Jer 6:4 , encourage themselves;
Jer 6:6 , God sets them on work because of their sins;
Jer 6:9 , The prophet laments the judgments of God because of their sins;
Jer 6:18 , He proclaims God's wrath;
Jer 6:26 , He calls the people to mourn for the judgment on their sins.
